**Outcome**:
- **Zero timeout failures**: Credentialing submission API response time reduced from 2-3 minutes (frequently timing out) to <300ms (always succeeds)
- **Eliminated thread pool exhaustion**: System now handles 500+ concurrent credentialing applications without performance degradation (10× previous capacity)
- **Improved provider experience**: Provider satisfaction score for credentialing workflow increased from 4.2/10 to 8.7/10
- **Support ticket reduction**: Credentialing-related support tickets dropped from 150/month to 12/month (92% reduction)
- **SLA compliance**: 24-hour credentialing turnaround time now achieved for 99.2% of applications (up from 73%)
- **Cost savings**: Eliminated $340K annual lost productivity from timeout-related failures
- **Infrastructure optimization**: Reduced API tier infrastructure costs by 35% ($28K/month savings) by eliminating over-provisioning for long-running operations

